naS\n\nThe code was previously assuming that the vertex stride is always larger than the vertex size which is not necessarily true per spec. This patches fixes that by computing the number of times the stride fits in the buffer after having removed the size of the last element (following a similar logic to what the (much better) webgpu spec describes to validate the equivalent API.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310994\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313724\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLContext.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLContext.h"], "git_node": "3cc892ae2e309922a08f53465c6d879df6b72bd6", "git_parents": ["dc3559b219f64f60f8389103bd2ebd237fc30bd2"], "node": "fcc40eb768519565b41aa2db2ea333667eb126e1", "parents": ["60f825f01e842ccdc9171df5e5a2f0e77185e0e7"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785409457, "git_changesets": ["3cc892ae2e309922a08f53465c6d879df6b72bd6"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1446": {"changesets": [{"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057308.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313983\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314206\n", "files": ["image/RasterImage.cpp", "image/RasterImage.h"], "git_node": "340b8b4c455a70a16f6e1f3416af63e08f54d260", "git_parents": ["3cc892ae2e309922a08f53465c6d879df6b72bd6"], "node": "2a327b8afff0972b3481e5339d02ea08a9fd9f2d", "parents": ["fcc40eb768519565b41aa2db2ea333667eb126e1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785528135, "git_changesets": ["340b8b4c455a70a16f6e1f3416af63e08f54d260"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1447": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053607.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311416\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315151\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/swgl/src