desc": "Bug 2061794.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317311\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317316\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/InterceptedHttpChannel.cpp"], "git_node": "3b8923470ea5ad164b6bfa2e49d8c7173b302f7e", "git_parents": ["76b03a954ce878091e122fcfc195ae4360073d02"], "node": "c5663c63f128f57323849fb3b4b564bb0200807e", "parents": ["798bc065742a4d7ad446690e936f89ccee99e62f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786416662, "git_changesets": ["3b8923470ea5ad164b6bfa2e49d8c7173b302f7e"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1489": {"changesets": [{"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@paul.cx\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052401 - Guard AudioCallbackDriver::mAudioStream with a DataMutex.  a=diannaS\n\nAudioOutputLatency() reads mAudioStream from the main thread\n(AudioContext.getOutputTimestamp()), while Init() writes it on the\nCubebOperation thread with no synchronization.\n\nEvery other access to mAudioStream is already CubebOperation-thread-only,\nso wrap it in a DataMutex, matching the existing mFallback pattern in this\nfile, rather than e.g. caching a latency value (which can change over the\nstream's life). The real-time audio callback thread never touches\nmAudioStream, so this lock is never contended on that path.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310300\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317495\n", "files": ["dom/media/GraphDriver.cpp", "dom/media/GraphDriver.h"], "git_node": "3a9e79f5904708ea8f13aad7c14a809337500a2d", "git_parents": ["3b8923470ea5ad164b6bfa2e49d8c7173b302f7e"], "node": "5d7f4d5bc4ccf389b904e3d6b7d839075ffc0a00", "parents": ["c5663c63f128f57323849fb3b4b564bb0200807e"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_115_39_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_115_39_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1786416871, "git_changesets": ["3a9e79f5904708ea8f13aad7c14a809337500a2d"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}}
}";